<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-θετέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must add</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must place before, furnish, serve</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφήν</span> (to the sick), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.216
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>one must place beside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σηκῷ σανίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					14.6.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must apply</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.23.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>one must compare</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγκον πρὸς ἄογκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.4.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
